    "source": "\n**Frame:** Split evidence panel. Left: `WHAT THE BOARD BELIEVED`, with the transcript-inspection diagram. Right: `WHAT OPENAI SAYS RAN`, with answer acceptance and no transcript-inspection arrow. A dusty amber gutter divides them.\n\n**Action:** The narrative reveals that belief and deployment are not the same account.\n\n**Caption:**\n> METR SAYS THE BOARD EXPECTED TRANSCRIPT REVIEW. OPENAI SAYS ITS DEPLOYED SCORER DID NOT PERFORM THAT CHECK.\n\n**Provenance:** `disputed` — attributed synthesis of `METR` and `OAI-OV`; the exact prompt, scorer configuration, and harness are not public.\n\n",
